{"steam_appid":4949360,"steam_name":"Undying Soul","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4949360/574088075/b43dc1ef7aec970a0e8ce5e28ca4944d9cb7f921/1784719936/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784722394","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257373894/22ff803034689f1ce86911e98367c53376572142/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784722394","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/5886e1919c8fc7fa30eeed77c2d0e2ab4c4e7d0c/ss_5886e1919c8fc7fa30eeed77c2d0e2ab4c4e7d0c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785054758","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/46125c6dbbcd3cfcd683d1e4178fae3d025e984d/ss_46125c6dbbcd3cfcd683d1e4178fae3d025e984d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785054758","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/19b05db8dab1f915ceb21416ee958a80449561c8/ss_19b05db8dab1f915ceb21416ee958a80449561c8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785054758","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/50cafbbb0a5b02ff53468c6eef7a9aba2099ddf3/ss_50cafbbb0a5b02ff53468c6eef7a9aba2099ddf3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785054758","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/56c3ca9b4b2b092508ec410888180db122a27eda/ss_56c3ca9b4b2b092508ec410888180db122a27eda.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785054758"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undying Soul is a 2D action roguelite platformer featuring fast-paced combat, deep build crafting, and challenging boss battles. Recover the fragments of your shattered soul and uncover the truth behind the curse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summon Fallen Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/839c0be8baadf73a99517d1a2f427fce.poster.avif?t=1785054758\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/839c0be8baadf73a99517d1a2f427fce.webm?t=1785054758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/839c0be8baadf73a99517d1a2f427fce.mp4?t=1785054758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The souls of fallen heroes are not lost—they fight alongside you. Summon unique companions, each with two distinct abilities that can reshape your combat style. Combine their abilities with your growing build to unlock new strategies and approach every run differently.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Own Playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/318ef857519a30004b5734710adcc2dd.poster.avif?t=1785054758\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/318ef857519a30004b5734710adcc2dd.webm?t=1785054758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/318ef857519a30004b5734710adcc2dd.mp4?t=1785054758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect dozens of unique items, upgrades, and relics throughout your journey. Experiment with different combinations, create devastating synergies, and build a playstyle that matches the way you fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overcome Deadly Trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/f665abe44f37fa0e75cdc1950261ac2e.poster.avif?t=1785054758\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/f665abe44f37fa0e75cdc1950261ac2e.webm?t=1785054758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/f665abe44f37fa0e75cdc1950261ac2e.mp4?t=1785054758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey is filled with dangerous encounters beyond ordinary combat. Face elite enemies, survive demanding challenges, and defeat fearsome mini-bosses to earn rewards that can turn the tide of your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Ancient Guardians</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/289c59b41f988c7e8eb1cec82731643c.poster.avif?t=1785054758\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/289c59b41f988c7e8eb1cec82731643c.webm?t=1785054758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/289c59b41f988c7e8eb1cec82731643c.mp4?t=1785054758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every chapter, a powerful guardian awaits. Each guardian protects a fragment of your shattered soul and demands a different strategy to overcome. Defeat them all to restore what was lost and bring your shattered soul back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Shader version 2.0 capable video card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["MipuDevs"],"publishers":["MipuDevs"],"release_date":"Coming soon"}